Package: PhysioAnalysis
Title: Analysis and Visualization for PhysioExperiment Objects
Version: 0.3.5
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Yusuke",
           family = "Matsui",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mail.to.matsui@gmail.com")
Description: Provides analysis and visualization functions for physiological
    signal data stored in 'PhysioExperiment' objects, which extend the
    Bioconductor 'SummarizedExperiment' container. Methods include the fast
    Fourier transform ('FFT'), time-frequency decomposition, epoching,
    functional connectivity (coherence and phase-based measures), graph and
    network metrics, statistical parametric mapping, and cluster-based
    permutation testing. Visualization utilities cover scalp topographic maps
    ('topoplots'), multichannel signal displays, and network graphs. Compiled
    routines are provided through 'Rcpp' and 'RcppArmadillo'.
Depends:
